WEBVTT

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Power Means Justice!

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.500
The Beast Knight, Duftmon

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:07.690
Power Means Justice!

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:09.500
The Beast Knight, Duftmon!

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:15.190
At last, the Royal Knights began the attack to purge the human world.

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:20.560
Tohma's father, Franz, and younger sister, Relena, were not exempted from the danger.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:27.370
Within that desperate situation, Tohma discovered a bond with his father for the first time.

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:32.110
After MirageGaogamon Burst-evolved and defeated RhodoKnightmon,

00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:35.760
Tohma decided to head for the Digital World.

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:44.910
Not only Dukemon, but now RhodoKnightmon has been brought down.

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:49.330
To think that the human opposition was this strong...

00:00:49.690 --> 00:00:53.540
But the human world must be eliminated.

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:55.810
It is the only way to save the Digital World.

00:00:55.810 --> 00:00:59.280
Then allow me to carry out that mission for you!

00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:01.110
Who is that?

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:03.430
You're...

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:04.780
Duftmon!

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:14.530
Duftmon

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:14.530
Ultimate Level

00:01:06.010 --> 00:01:06.960
Duftmon.

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:09.600
An Ultimate Level Digimon who believes that power means justice.

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:12.460
He is the leading strategist among the Royal Knights.

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:14.530
His special attack is Ernste Wehr.

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:16.500
What's this?

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:19.030
You've never voluntarily made a move before now.

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:25.000
We are dealing with a serious matter that is putting the destruction of the Digital World in question!

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:29.540
O remarkably brave and honorable Duftmon.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.320
I shall trust your abilities.

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:34.340
Yggdrasil.

00:01:34.340 --> 00:01:40.330
I will show you that the humans are a worthless existence before the might of Digimon.

00:01:49.190 --> 00:01:51.360
It's like a ghost town.

00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:53.840
The situation is the worst.

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:58.020
DATS subdivisions around the world are doing everything they can to fight the Royal Knights,

00:01:58.020 --> 00:01:59.820
but the damages on our side keep rising.

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:01.570
I'll fight, too!

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:05.580
I share the same sentiment, but we made a promise with Masaru, remember?

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:09.410
Our duty is the protect this place.

00:02:09.410 --> 00:02:11.540
We have to work harder for Tohma's share as well now.

00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:14.800
Can the Digital World be turned back to normal?

00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:20.760
Professor Noguchi and the others are frantically searching for a way to repair the dimensional barrier.

00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:24.850
I wonder if the day this town is restored to normal will ever come.

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:26.220
It'll come!

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:27.310
I'm sure it'll come!

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:28.780
Yeah.

00:02:28.780 --> 00:02:31.580
We must take back the peaceful world we've lost!

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:33.120
Yoshino, what's that?

00:02:36.740 --> 00:02:37.880
A tornado!

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:39.590
It's heading towards Masaru's house!

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:41.030
Mom!

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:42.240
Chika!

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:55.920
Mom... there's something in the garden.

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:56.380
Yes.

00:02:58.140 --> 00:02:59.040
Oh my...

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:01.020
Are you all right?

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:03.020
Yoshino-san.

00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:07.450
These are... Baby Digimon!

00:03:07.510 --> 00:03:08.640
Pyocomon

00:03:07.560 --> 00:03:16.900
Baby Level

00:03:08.180 --> 00:03:09.130
Pyocomon.

00:03:08.640 --> 00:03:09.640
Tokomon

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:10.010
Tokomon.

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:10.640
Pukamon

00:03:10.010 --> 00:03:10.900
Pukamon.

00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:11.640
Punimon

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:12.020
Punimon.

00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:12.640
Otamamon

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:13.100
Otamamon.

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:13.650
Babumon

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:14.040
Babumon.

00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:14.650
Nyaromon

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:15.000
Nyaromon.

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:15.650
Poromon

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:15.920
Poromon.

00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:16.900
YukimiBotamon

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:17.800
YukimiBotamon.

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:19.790
All of them are Baby Digimon.

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:22.780
They have the ability to evolve into many different kinds of Digimon.

00:03:25.110 --> 00:03:25.940
Piyomon...

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:28.120
<i>I'm Piyomon.</i>

00:03:28.780 --> 00:03:30.390
<i>Nice to meet you, Chika.</i>

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:34.670
<i>Nice to meet you, Piyomon!</i>

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:38.360
<i>Chika.</i>

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:38.800
<i>Piyomon?</i>

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:41.370
<i>I'll protect you.</i>

00:03:42.690 --> 00:03:43.650
<i>Piyomon!</i>

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:45.840
<i>CHIKA!</i>

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:50.000
Piyomon...

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:52.320
Piyomon!

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:56.180
Piyomon!

00:04:57.150 --> 00:04:58.840
You came to see me, right?

00:05:01.020 --> 00:05:01.960
You're...

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:03.280
Who are you?

00:05:06.460 --> 00:05:08.720
There, there. Good boy.

00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:17.390
Drink all you want.

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:19.160
Piyomon...

00:05:19.950 --> 00:05:22.470
Is it really that Piyomon?

00:05:22.470 --> 00:05:23.110
Yes.

00:05:23.360 --> 00:05:25.650
I can tell.

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:27.650
He doesn't remember anymore.

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:32.220
His memories are gone now because he'd been turned back into a Digiegg.

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:38.350
<i>Now he no longer has to suffer...</i>

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:39.710
<i>Thank goodness...</i>

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:41.380
Piyomon.

00:05:41.380 --> 00:05:43.930
Have you really forgotten about me?

00:05:43.930 --> 00:05:45.170
Are you sure you can't remember?

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:47.630
I'm sorry...

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:51.670
Falcomon, is this Piyomon...?

00:05:51.670 --> 00:05:52.400
Yeah.

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:55.520
He's from the Digiegg we planned to raise together.

00:05:55.990 --> 00:05:58.190
I see. He's our...

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:00.590
<i>Who the hell are you?!</i>

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:01.860
<i>Where's the egg?</i>

00:06:02.770 --> 00:06:04.110
<i>Give back the egg!</i>

00:06:04.700 --> 00:06:08.570
Falcomon came to the human world chasing after that Digiegg.

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:11.990
And that's how we met Masaru and the others.

00:06:12.340 --> 00:06:13.740
Yeah...

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:17.700
By the way, why are you guys in the human world?

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:20.000
Well...

00:06:20.550 --> 00:06:22.960
We were blown over here.

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:24.630
Blown over?

00:06:25.520 --> 00:06:30.050
The Digital World is having serious difficulties right now.

00:06:30.650 --> 00:06:33.700
Ever since the human world appeared in the sky,

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:37.460
there have been endless earthquakes and volcanic eruptions...

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:39.870
Even storms and tidal waves attacked us...

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:45.250
A lot of Digimon lost their homes.

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:50.060
We were looking for a place to hide when a huge tornado hit us.

00:06:54.710 --> 00:06:57.330
When we came to, we found ourselves falling here.

00:06:59.470 --> 00:07:05.040
But I guess this means not all Digimon think that the human world should be erased.

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:08.430
You guys are also victims.

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:13.260
What's going to happen to us?

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:19.060
I guess there's no other choice.

00:07:20.430 --> 00:07:23.480
I'll look after every single one of you!

00:07:25.490 --> 00:07:27.540
I mean, there's nothing else we can do.

00:07:27.540 --> 00:07:29.850
We certainly can't send you back into all of that chaos.

00:07:29.850 --> 00:07:32.280
But where will you take care of them?

00:07:32.280 --> 00:07:34.070
At my place, of course.

00:07:34.070 --> 00:07:36.200
But there's no floor to step on.

00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:38.850
You can use our place!

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:40.970
Piyomon.

00:07:40.970 --> 00:07:44.520
Even if you don't remember, I do.

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:47.890
We promised we'd always be together.

00:07:47.890 --> 00:07:51.380
I believe that being able to meet you again isn't a coincidence.

00:07:53.510 --> 00:07:56.780
I'm glad to be given a reason to cook again!

00:08:01.510 --> 00:08:03.290
Yoshino, what are you doing?

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:04.530
Oh, be quiet.

00:08:04.530 --> 00:08:05.940
I'm helping out, too.

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:11.230
Yoshino, there's trouble!

00:08:11.830 --> 00:08:13.700
What's wrong? Is it the enemy?!

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:14.700
Falcomon is...!

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:17.180
Help me!

00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:18.130
What happened?

00:08:19.050 --> 00:08:20.620
Someone help!

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:22.580
We have trouble!

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:24.290
What now?!

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:25.890
Over here!

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:35.730
You guys...

00:08:35.730 --> 00:08:37.830
Let's all stay put, shall we?

00:08:39.150 --> 00:08:40.460
Good grief...

00:08:43.030 --> 00:08:46.310
There won't be room for any food if you stay in here!

00:08:46.650 --> 00:08:49.070
Let go!

00:08:50.070 --> 00:08:51.980
Hey! Stop that!

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:11.550
CUT IT OUT!

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:20.320
You wouldn't...!

00:09:30.280 --> 00:09:32.430
It's like a Digimon kindergarten.

00:09:32.430 --> 00:09:34.540
I'm sorry, Chika-chan.

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:37.320
Just when I said I'd look after them, too.

00:09:37.320 --> 00:09:39.260
No, I'm having fun!

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:41.620
I love it when things are lively.

00:09:42.110 --> 00:09:44.290
I admit, I enjoyed myself, too.

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:46.330
It's been a while since I've found something worth doing.

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:48.660
Such as?

00:09:49.640 --> 00:09:50.390
Well...

00:09:50.390 --> 00:09:53.650
I'm always looking after Masaru and Tohma,

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:55.660
so this isn't all that different.

00:09:55.660 --> 00:09:59.390
I actually think it's those two who are always looking after you.

00:09:59.390 --> 00:10:00.500
What was that?

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:02.850
Anyway...

00:10:02.850 --> 00:10:05.520
I just think I should do my best as well.

00:10:09.260 --> 00:10:11.900
Here you go! I'm sorry to have kept you waiting.

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:14.790
Let's eat!

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:14.790
Let's eat!

00:10:14.790 --> 00:10:17.790
{onkei: Birds using chopsticks. xD} {Splash: YES! *clenches fist in victory*}

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:25.990
Delicious!

00:10:25.990 --> 00:10:28.540
I didn't know emergency rations could taste so good...

00:10:28.830 --> 00:10:30.770
Eat as much as you want, everyone.

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:33.140
Sayuri is a carrot at cooking!

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:36.550
NOTE: Ikuto says <i>ninjin</i> (carrot) when he means <i>tatsujin</i> (expert).

00:10:33.140 --> 00:10:35.100
You mean she's an expert!

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:36.550
Yeah, carrot!

00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:38.210
Here.

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:40.430
Eat up.

00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:42.060
Thanks.

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:57.940
Why did you come back here, Sayuri-san?

00:10:58.190 --> 00:10:59.180
Well...

00:11:00.150 --> 00:11:02.610
I wanted to greet them here when they came back.

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:07.200
I'm sure Masaru will bring Suguru-san back with him.

00:11:07.970 --> 00:11:08.890
Yeah.

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:13.710
I wonder how Masaru-niichan and Agumon are doing now...

00:11:17.670 --> 00:11:19.130
Aniki...

00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:20.970
Yeah?

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:23.430
I'm thirsty...

00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:25.260
So am I...

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:29.220
Damn it, of all the places we had to fall in...

00:11:32.070 --> 00:11:34.940
That air turbulence is even worse than before.

00:11:36.730 --> 00:11:38.810
Ah, something just glittered.

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:45.700
What's that?

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:53.040
Gotsumon!

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:55.500
Oh, it's you...

00:11:55.820 --> 00:11:57.610
Daimon Osaru and Ahomon!

00:11:55.820 --> 00:12:00.460
NOTE: <i>Osaru</i> means Monkey, <i>Aho</i> means Moron.

00:11:57.610 --> 00:11:58.740
Who are you calling a monkey?!

00:11:58.740 --> 00:12:00.460
I'm not a moron, I'm Agumon!

00:12:01.310 --> 00:12:03.930
Anyway, how'd you end up falling from the sky?

00:12:04.730 --> 00:12:09.340
After we separated, I've been roaming about everywhere,

00:12:09.340 --> 00:12:12.390
when suddenly a tornado swallowed me up.

00:12:12.930 --> 00:12:13.650
Aniki.

00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:14.630
Yeah.

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:15.780
This is perfect.

00:12:15.780 --> 00:12:17.230
Take us to that tree again.

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:22.440
That meal was great!

00:12:22.780 --> 00:12:25.450
It's been so long since we've stuffed ourselves!

00:12:27.020 --> 00:12:29.270
Piyomon, do you like this place?

00:12:29.270 --> 00:12:31.740
We're not being nuisances, are we?

00:12:31.740 --> 00:12:33.740
It's okay! Don't worry about it!

00:12:33.740 --> 00:12:34.750
That's right!

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:37.530
Is it really okay for us to be here?

00:12:41.810 --> 00:12:43.630
<i>Hey, is it...</i>

00:12:44.690 --> 00:12:48.340
<i>Is it really okay for me to... be here?</i>

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:50.140
<i>Huh?</i>

00:12:56.460 --> 00:12:57.900
<i>Of course it is.</i>

00:12:58.670 --> 00:13:01.280
I'll be your aniki.

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:02.290
Aniki?

00:13:02.290 --> 00:13:04.480
Masaru protected everyone.

00:13:04.480 --> 00:13:05.990
I'll protect everyone, too.

00:13:06.420 --> 00:13:08.260
I'll protect all of you!

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:09.290
Me, too!

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:11.630
Aniki!

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:12.950
Aniki!

00:13:14.490 --> 00:13:15.040
Aniki!

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:16.070
Aniki!

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:16.330
Aniki!

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:20.630
All right!

00:13:20.630 --> 00:13:22.100
Time for a pillow fight!

00:13:22.100 --> 00:13:23.200
Yeah!

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:25.680
Hey!

00:13:25.680 --> 00:13:26.700
Keep it down!

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:32.420
You guys...

00:13:32.420 --> 00:13:33.950
If you keep banging about...!

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:37.800
Th-That wasn't me!

00:13:37.800 --> 00:13:38.920
I know that!

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:41.860
It's the enemy.

00:13:47.670 --> 00:13:50.400
Weak and foolish humans.

00:13:50.400 --> 00:13:52.950
Accept Yggdrasil's verdict!

00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:55.240
Sword of Annihilation!

00:13:55.240 --> 00:13:56.960
Aussterben!

00:13:55.240 --> 00:13:58.470
NOTE: <i>Aussterben</i> is German for "Extinction."

00:13:59.950 --> 00:14:02.630
The weak should perish.

00:14:05.140 --> 00:14:06.340
Be careful.

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:08.170
Okay.

00:14:08.650 --> 00:14:11.180
Will we be forced to leave this place, too?

00:14:11.610 --> 00:14:12.760
It's all right.

00:14:12.760 --> 00:14:14.350
Don't worry.

00:14:15.010 --> 00:14:17.010
We'll protect this place.

00:14:17.010 --> 00:14:18.060
Relax.

00:14:24.870 --> 00:14:25.730
This is...

00:14:27.780 --> 00:14:29.740
The city is... disappearing!

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:31.450
No way...

00:14:31.450 --> 00:14:32.470
Where is the enemy?

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:35.580
Over there!

00:14:36.090 --> 00:14:37.980
I can't allow any more destruction!

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:38.710
Lalamon!

00:14:38.710 --> 00:14:39.370
Okay!

00:14:39.750 --> 00:14:41.280
Let's go, Falcomon!

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:41.960
Yeah!

00:14:45.290 --> 00:14:47.330
Digisoul Charge!

00:14:45.290 --> 00:14:47.330
Digisoul Charge!

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:48.660
Overdrive!

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:48.660
Overdrive!

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:51.130
Lalamon, evolve!

00:14:51.130 --> 00:14:52.520
Falcomon, evolve!

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:06.570
Rosemon!

00:15:15.120 --> 00:15:16.620
Ravemon!

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:19.030
Aussterben!

00:15:20.240 --> 00:15:22.440
Roses Rapier!

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:25.720
Spiral Raven Claw!

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:35.090
We won't let you lay a hand on the human world!

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:35.090
We won't let you lay a hand on the human world!

00:15:35.610 --> 00:15:38.060
Go back to the Digital World!

00:15:35.610 --> 00:15:38.060
Go back to the Digital World!

00:15:38.350 --> 00:15:41.140
You dare to spout orders at me?

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:42.350
Don't be ridiculous!

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:50.340
How powerless you are.

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:53.050
You're not even qualified to stand before me.

00:15:54.210 --> 00:15:55.960
Now you've said it!

00:15:55.960 --> 00:15:56.840
Rosemon!

00:15:56.840 --> 00:15:57.910
Ravemon!

00:15:58.250 --> 00:15:59.880
Roses Rapier!

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:02.880
Blast Wing!

00:16:06.060 --> 00:16:06.840
What?

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:08.040
You bore me tremendously.

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:13.780
Rosemon!

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:15.130
Ravemon!

00:16:17.440 --> 00:16:20.050
I hope Yoshino-oneechan and the others are all right.

00:16:20.050 --> 00:16:22.420
Let's trust in their abilities right now.

00:16:22.420 --> 00:16:24.250
I'm going to take a look!

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:24.980
Chika!

00:16:30.560 --> 00:16:34.390
Why can't both Digimon and humans get along?

00:16:34.390 --> 00:16:35.950
It's dangerous out here.

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:37.240
Piyomon?

00:16:40.150 --> 00:16:41.010
Rosemon!

00:16:41.010 --> 00:16:41.950
Ravemon!

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:44.330
The human world will be obliterated.

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:46.710
That is Yggdrasil's decision.

00:16:46.710 --> 00:16:48.920
You cannot stop me from fulfilling it!

00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:51.580
We'll never let that happen!

00:16:51.580 --> 00:16:53.630
We'll protect everyone!

00:16:54.670 --> 00:16:56.320
Spiral Raven Claw!

00:16:59.320 --> 00:17:00.480
Thorn Whip!

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:05.470
Sword of Destruction!

00:17:05.470 --> 00:17:07.470
Ernste Wehr!

00:17:05.470 --> 00:17:09.810
NOTE: <i>Ernste Wehr</i> is German for "Earnest Resistance."

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:12.260
They're coming closer!

00:17:12.690 --> 00:17:13.820
You guys...!

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:17.240
Rosemon.

00:17:17.240 --> 00:17:18.190
Yoshino...

00:17:18.190 --> 00:17:20.240
We can't let him pass through here, or else...

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:23.280
Chika-chan!

00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:23.910
Piyomon!

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:30.080
Trying to challenge me at your level of power is contemptible.

00:17:30.720 --> 00:17:31.850
Stop this!

00:17:32.170 --> 00:17:37.340
There are Digimon who were blown from the Digital World up ahead!

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:41.640
Then they will have to disappear along with the human world!

00:17:43.070 --> 00:17:44.300
Why?!

00:17:44.300 --> 00:17:46.320
You destroy human world

00:17:46.320 --> 00:17:48.980
because you want to save the Digimon, isn't it?!

00:17:49.340 --> 00:17:52.610
Saving the Digital World is justice.

00:17:52.610 --> 00:17:56.490
The small number of Digimon lives that are sacrificed in the name of justice is meaningless!

00:17:58.210 --> 00:17:59.830
We will protect them!

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:02.730
Both the people <i>and</i>  the places we care for!

00:18:02.730 --> 00:18:03.360
Yeah!

00:18:02.730 --> 00:18:03.360
Yeah!

00:18:04.050 --> 00:18:05.770
You still dare to argue with me?

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:07.250
Ernste Wehr!

00:18:08.090 --> 00:18:10.490
Forbidden Temptation!

00:18:12.100 --> 00:18:13.840
Ame-no-ohabari!

00:18:25.990 --> 00:18:27.280
Piyomon?

00:18:27.280 --> 00:18:28.370
It's all right.

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:29.470
I'll protect you.

00:18:32.390 --> 00:18:33.360
What happened to Chika-chan and the others?

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:35.320
Chika...

00:18:35.320 --> 00:18:36.490
I will protect you!

00:18:37.190 --> 00:18:37.970
Piyomon?

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:39.000
You're unharmed!

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:40.320
He evolved!

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:42.940
You're a very stubborn bunch.

00:18:42.940 --> 00:18:45.110
But I'll be putting an end to this soon enough.

00:18:46.240 --> 00:18:49.060
So that Masaru and the others can return home...

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:51.420
We will protect this place!

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:55.880
My duty is to protect everyone!

00:19:06.430 --> 00:19:07.330
Charge!

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:12.030
Digisoul Burst!

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:19.990
Ravemon!

00:19:19.990 --> 00:19:21.660
Burst Mode!

00:19:25.160 --> 00:19:25.860
Charge!

00:19:28.010 --> 00:19:30.880
Digisoul Burst!

00:19:38.420 --> 00:19:39.540
Rosemon!

00:19:39.540 --> 00:19:40.970
Burst Mode!

00:19:41.220 --> 00:19:51.060
Ravemon

00:19:41.220 --> 00:19:51.060
Burst
Mode

00:19:41.980 --> 00:19:44.140
Ravemon Burst Mode.

00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:48.120
The appearance that Ravemon takes on after using Burst Evolution to temporarily activate the limits of his power.

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:51.060
His special attack is Dotou-yami-kumo-no-mai.

00:19:51.130 --> 00:20:00.990
Rosemon

00:19:51.130 --> 00:20:00.990
Burst
Mode

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:53.770
Rosemon Burst Mode.

00:19:53.770 --> 00:19:57.840
The appearance that Rosemon takes on after using Burst Evolution to temporarily activate the limits of her power.

00:19:57.840 --> 00:20:00.990
Her special attacks are Charité and Aguichant Lèvres.

00:20:02.710 --> 00:20:03.450
This is...

00:20:04.190 --> 00:20:05.810
Burst Mode?!

00:20:06.710 --> 00:20:07.750
My...

00:20:07.940 --> 00:20:09.270
My...

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:10.630
Burst Mode!

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:10.630
Burst Mode!

00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:12.630
Rosemon!

00:20:13.470 --> 00:20:14.420
Ravemon!

00:20:16.810 --> 00:20:18.030
You...!

00:20:18.430 --> 00:20:20.420
One-sided justice...

00:20:20.790 --> 00:20:22.220
Isn't justice at all!

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:25.210
Dotou-yami-kumo-no-mai!

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:25.210
Dark Dance of the Raging Waves Following Mourning

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:36.630
Aguichant Lèvres!

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:38.650
NOTE: <i>Aguichant Lèvres</i> is French for "Arousing Lips."

00:20:40.890 --> 00:20:45.460
The human world shall suffer Yggdrasil's judgment!

00:20:50.870 --> 00:20:53.750
So you really insist on going to the Digital World?

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:57.140
The Royal Knights' way of thinking is wrong.

00:20:57.140 --> 00:20:59.210
We've decided that we must fight!

00:20:59.770 --> 00:21:03.710
We have no other choice but to fight if we want to protect what's important to us.

00:21:03.710 --> 00:21:05.170
I'll fight, too!

00:21:06.140 --> 00:21:09.810
Piyomon, can you protect everyone for us?

00:21:10.980 --> 00:21:11.980
Okay.

00:21:11.980 --> 00:21:13.720
I'll protect everyone.

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:15.400
Piyomon.

00:21:16.700 --> 00:21:19.610
Our feelings are one, after all.

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:21.610
Tohma!

00:21:23.140 --> 00:21:24.650
You've settled things on your side, have you?

00:21:25.030 --> 00:21:25.830
Yeah.

00:21:26.960 --> 00:21:28.430
Well, let's go!

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:29.120
Yeah!

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:29.120
Yeah!

